# Line endings: LF in the repo and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows installs with core.autocrlf=true, so a default Windows clone
# checks text files out with CRLF. The checks in scripts/ read files as LF:
# on such a clone verify-manifesto-date.mjs cannot find CAREEROPS_DEFINITION in
# shared.ts and faq-from-mdx.mjs --check reports faq-data.ts out of date, while
# both pass on the same commit checked out with LF. Same policy as the core repo.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalized
*.avif  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
